#: ../../src/dialogs/ConfigDialogue.cpp:2732
msgid ""
"\"OpenAI-compatible\" covers most third-party and self-hosted APIs "
"(OpenRouter, Groq, a local Ollama server, ...) -- pick Anthropic's or "
"Google's own style only for an endpoint that actually speaks that provider's "
"specific request/response format (e.g. a proxy in front of one of them)."
msgstr ""

